      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Mose ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wambile Bena Isalele ne, Nakasungula matuku andi musue bantu badie bidia bia Yehowa anudi mua kumanyisha bantu, matuku au neikale matuku a tshijila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukuate mudimu matuku asambombo kadi dituku dia muanda mutekete ndituku dia lumingu dia kuikisha, dituku dia disangisha dia tshijila, kanuenji mudimu, edi ndituku dia lumingu dia Yehowa mu nsubu yenu yonso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au mmatuku a kudia bidia bia Yehowa, matuku a tshijila andi musue wewe ubamanyishe ku bikondo biau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngondo wa kumudilu, mu matuku dikumi ne anai, diba dia dilolo, ndituku dia kuhita kua Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dituku dia matuku dikumi ne atanu a ngondo eu mene ndituku dia kudila Yehowa bidia bidi kabiyi ne luevene, nenudie bidia bidi kabiyi ne Iuevene matuku muanda mutekete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dituku dia kumudilu nedikale dituku dia tshijila, kanuenji mudimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nenufile milambu ya kuoshila Yehowa ha kahia tô matuku muanda mutekete, dituku dia muanda mutekete ndituku dia tshijila, kanuenji mudimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakambila Mose ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wambile Bena Isalele ne, Hanuabuela mu buloba bundi nnuha, ne hanuahuola bintu bia mu buloba, nulue bienu ne bintu binudi nuhuola diambedi kudi muakuidi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yeye neanyukule tshisumbu tshia bintu ku mpala kua Yehowa, bualu bua kunuitabushisha kudi Yehowa, muakuidi neatshinyukule dituku didi dilonda dia lumingu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku dinudi nunyukula bintu, nenufile muana mulume wa mukoko wa tshidimu tshimue udi kayi ne tshilema bu mulambu wa kuoshila Yehowa ha kahia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenufile diatshimue ne mulambu wa bukula wa bituha bibidi bia dikumi bia épha",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.13, 17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lewitiki 5.11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " busangisha ne manyi, mulambu wa kutua dihembu dimpe muoshile Yehowa, nenufile mulambu wa nvinyo wa kunua wa tshituha tshinai tshia hin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lewitiki 19.36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanudi mampa anyi manvua akoshabo mu kahia, anyi manvua mabishi dituku edi diambedi kanuyi banze kufila milambu yenu kudi Nzambi eu udi mukenji wa tshiendelele mu bikondo bienu bionso mu nsubu yenu yonso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenubange ku dituku didi dilonda dia lumingu, dituku dinuakalua ne tshisumbu tshia bintu bidibo banyukula, nenubale matuku a lumingu muanda mutekete, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tô ne ku dituku didi dilonda dituku dia lumingu dia muanda mutekete bu matuku makumi atanu nenufile mulambu wa bukula buhia-buhia kudi Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenufume ku nsubu yenu ne mitanda ya mampa ibidi ya kunyukula, milamba ne bituha bibidi bia dikumi bia épha ya bukula bubotesha busangisha ne luevene, ebi mbintu bihuola bia diambedi bifila kudi Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nulue ne mampa au ne bana ba mikoko muanda mutekete ba tshidimu tshimue badi kabayi ne bilema ne muana mulume wa ngombe ne bimpanga bibidi, bintu ebi nebikale bu mulambu wa kuoshila Yehowa ha kahia, udibo bafila ne mulambu wa bukula ne mulambu wa bintu bia kunua, bu mulambu wa kuosha ha kahia udi utua dihembu kudi Yehowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenufile mpumbu wa mbushi umue bu mulambu wa kubuikila nʼau bubi ne bana balume ba mikoko babidi ba tshidimu tshimue bu mulambu wa kuvuisha nʼau ditalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muakuidi neanyukule bintu ebi ne mampa a bintu biakahuolabo diambedi ne bana ba mikoko babidi bu mulambu udibo banyukula ku mesu kua Yehowa, nebikale bintu bia tshijila kudi Yehowa bualu bua muakuidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe newambile bantu dituku adi bua dituku adi dikale dituku dia disangisha dia tshijila kunudi, kanuenji mudimu eu udi mukenji wa tshiendelele mu nsubu yenu yonso tô ne mu bikondo bienu bionso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuahuola bintu binuakakuna mu buloba, kanuhuodi ku matengu a madimi, kanusangishi bintu bionso, nenushiye bintu ebi bua kukuatshisha nʼabi bahele ne benyi meme ndi Yehowa, Nzambi wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
